From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:15:50 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/22] MenuItem: support items made from the layout

Setters for synthetic categories, name and description overrides, extra
keywords, breadcrumb and visibility in the sidebar and in search. The
existing API is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
